  "credited_compliance": [],
  "compliance_time_text": "Engines overhauled or repaired since new: replace each affected cylinder assembly at no later than 800 operating hours-in-service (HIS) if it has fewer than 800 HIS on the effective date; if it has 800 HIS or more on the effective date, replace within 60 operating HIS after the effective date.",
  "unsafe_condition_summary": "Cracks in the cylinder assemblies can cause loss of engine power and possible engine failure caused by separation of a cylinder head.",
