  "notes": "revises: not an EASA AD, so no Revision field; field_quotes.revises is empty. Applicability: the AD covers Lycoming 320/360/540 series engines only for the models specified in Table 1, so the series rows over-include (model suffixes not in Table 1 are not applicable); series rows were used because Table 1 is too large to quote per model, and their prefixes are those listed in Table 1 (VO-360, IVO-360 and others appearing only in Table 2 are excluded). Dashes in the AD text are en-dashes; values use plain hyphens. All applicability rows share the same paragraph (c) quote. Serial range 1-9879 refers to cylinder assembly serials, not engine serials, so engine serial_from/serial_to are null. No credited compliance paragraph: AD 2005-26-10 is superseded, but no text credits its compliance."
